WEBVTT

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.440
This is Shining Tower?

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.880
It's so tall!

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.130
What is this?

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:14.920
Shining Saotome financed its construction 
himself to promote the Triple S!

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.920
Sounds like Shining Saotome!

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.940
It's the tallest in the world!

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:21.300
You can't even see the top!

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.910
Wow!

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:35.570
I'd like you to write a song to play 
at this tower's opening reception!

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.010
Yes, sir.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:40.010
Very well.

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:52.850
I'll do my best!

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.760
Camus-senpai.

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:50.480
I'd like to discuss the song's image.

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:52.980
First compose a song.

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.440
Then we'll talk.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:57.840
Then let's discuss that...

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:00.490
I don't have time to listen to fools.

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:01.670
But...

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:05.830
Huh?

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:09.190
Cecil-san...

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:11.830
Why would you do that to Haruka?

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:14.710
I did nothing.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:17.590
She tripped by herself.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.170
Haruka's not that clumsy!

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.890
It doesn't matter.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.830
Camus-senpai!

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:32.690
Come to me once you've composed a song.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:39.320
Haruka, are you all right?

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:41.720
Thank you.

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:44.810
I'm worried.

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:45.380
What?

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:48.200
Camus is cold-hearted.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:52.040
Cold-hearted? 
I don't think he's cold-hearted.

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.410
No. I share a room with him.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.420
Living with him is awful.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.340
Awful?

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:00.600
Yes...

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:05.010
He makes me line up all night 
to buy limited edition rice cakes.

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:09.700
He wakes me up in the middle 
of the night to brew coffee.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.560
He does that?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:15.730
Yes. He's cold, arrogant, insolent...

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:21.470
But he does everything perfectly.

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:24.510
Everything perfectly?

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:28.080
Yes. His singing, acting, everything.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:31.270
But he never does anything in earnest.

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:33.850
Do your best.

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:37.420
I love your songs.

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:38.680
I will.

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:40.790
Thank you.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.670
<i>An insincere, but perfect person...</i>

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:00.370
<i>What kind of person is that?</i>

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:06.630
I know!

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:22.610
Thank you, Camus.

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:26.100
You did an incredible job.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.100
Thank you.

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:31.720
The song you sang today has topped 
the charts for ten weeks straight.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:36.400
So we've received all of these 
flowers to congratulate you.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:38.980
Thank you.

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:45.440
I have everyone here 
and the ladies at home to thank.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.450
Amazing...

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:55.640
Camus-senpai!

00:05:58.150 --> 00:05:59.210
Um...

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.720
Did you write the song?

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:03.500
No, not yet.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.550
What do you want, then?

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.410
I want to know more about you.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.390
About me?

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:17.520
I want to know more about you 
and write a song worthy of you.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:19.980
So I...

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:24.190
Please let me watch you work!

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:30.560
Please!

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:34.200
I need to know more about you, 
so I can write a song!

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:36.160
I'll do anything!

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:40.000
I won't get in your way, so...

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:44.800
Very well.

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:47.760
Thank you!

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:49.770
I'll do my best!

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:50.720
However...

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:55.720
Only if you'll be my servant.

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:59.050
What? Servant?

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:02.340
Let's move.

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:04.770
What? Um...

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:07.230
Camus-senpai?

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:10.700
Those flowers are for me.

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:13.220
Send them to my room.

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:14.200
Oh...

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:17.910
What? Um, I... what?

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:19.260
Quickly.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:27.210
<i>Grandmother, I think I got 
myself into quite the mess.</i>

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.930
The next location is...

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:37.380
Modeling work at a studio within the city 
for women's fashion magazine "Lady Go."

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:40.850
After that, I'm filming 
a commercial at another studio.

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:45.580
After that, I'm recording 
a guest appearance for a radio station.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.340
Y-You remember everything?

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:57.490
Good morning.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:58.890
Good morning.

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:01.000
W-Wait for me!

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:03.910
Good morning.

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:05.170
Good morning.

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:06.330
Good morning, Camus-kun.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:06.880
Camus-san is here.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.170
Good morning.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.380
It's been so long.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:12.180
Sorry for asking you to do this.

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:12.940
It's fine.

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:15.230
About today's shoot...

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:15.930
Yes?

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:18.400
This is the brand's image.

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:18.890
All right.

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:22.860
How about this? 
I think it'd look good on you.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.860
<i>What a gentle smile...</i>

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:23.440
Okay.

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:28.020
Something's missing...

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:29.670
Give me a moment.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:35.570
Hey. Give me the book 
I handed you earlier.

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:36.160
What?

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:37.320
Oh, okay.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.370
Is this it?

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:47.050
Why don't we use this book to create 
a formal and intellectual atmosphere?

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:49.610
Well done, Camus-kun.

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:51.300
Great idea.

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:53.810
Do you always read this stuff?

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:55.630
No, it's a coincidence.

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.870
Let's use this, then.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:58.470
Okay.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:19.890
Good, good!

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:21.950
Now try turning, Camus-kun!

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:26.850
Turn around! Good!

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:30.770
Next, let's...

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:35.650
Good work.

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:40.140
That was amazing, Camus-senpai.

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:41.610
Of course it was.

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:56.500
When I snap my fingers once, bring tea.

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:57.940
Twice means coffee.

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:00.380
Warm the milk first.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.380
What? Um...

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:02.030
Careful with the sugar.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.070
O-Okay!

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:07.000
Warm the milk... careful with the sugar...

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:11.430
O-Okay! I'm on it!

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.010
Hey, little lamb.

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.060
Guys.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.870
Good evening, Nanami-san.

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:26.300
What a coincidence.

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:27.350
What are you doing?

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:30.170
Are you having tea?

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:31.860
Nice.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:35.440
Actually, this is...

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.670
Haruka, are you...

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:43.080
Camus!

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:49.000
What are you making Haruka do?

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.920
It's none of your business.

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.430
It is my business!

00:10:56.920 --> 00:11:00.710
She's simply acting as my servant.

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:01.960
Your servant?

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:04.220
What are you talking about?

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:11.400
If servant offends you, call her maid, 
assistant, attendant, or whatever you please.

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.890
Camus, you're unbelievable!

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:14.720
Cecil-san!

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:18.040
Cecil-san, you're wrong!

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:18.990
Haruka?

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:21.490
What's going on?

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:41.880
I see.

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:44.370
So that's how it is.

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:48.680
You're serving Camus-senpai, 
so you can write your song.

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:49.960
Yes.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.370
I refuse to accept this!

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.440
He can't do this to you!

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:59.190
But if she accepts it, 
there's nothing we can do.

00:11:59.720 --> 00:12:02.610
What's the song's deadline?

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:07.590
The song's being performed 
at the Shining Tower's opening ceremony...

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:09.070
Which means...

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:10.580
That's this weekend.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.460
What? You've only got a few days left!

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:16.760
Yes, I know...

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:22.030
You'll be fine. I know you'll 
compose something wonderful.

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:28.800
When you're composing for me, 
maybe I should be your butler.

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:30.030
Jinguji-san!

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:31.570
Hey, Jinguji!

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:37.500
Why don't we all serve Haru-chan?

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.270
That doesn't make any sense.

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:43.220
Guys, give this some serious thought!

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:46.110
It's okay, Cecil-san.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:49.450
Thank you, everyone.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:55.310
I'll do my best to write something 
Camus-senpai will approve.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:08.140
I'm going to make some fresh tea.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:15.630
She seems to be having fun.

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:20.440
I never understand what she's trying to do.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.150
Really?

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:24.120
It's obviously pointless.

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:28.200
Don't be that way.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:31.540
She's doing her best.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.280
Her best?

00:13:33.280 --> 00:13:34.630
I know.

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:37.480
Should we work hard at something, too?

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:38.120
What?

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:40.000
Sounds stupid.

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:44.320
You're all so cold!

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:46.760
But...

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:52.390
Let's watch and see how she does.

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:20.060
<i>Camus-senpai...</i>

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:27.150
<i>A kind and gentle top idol 
with a gorgeous smile.</i>

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:32.500
<i>He's noble, pure, and cold.</i>

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:36.120
<i>Like the aurora covering 
the skies of icy nations.</i>

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:43.380
<i>A man who calmly does everything perfectly.</i>

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:01.380
Camus-senpai,

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.140
I've written a song.

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:10.800
I heard you never do anything in earnest.

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:15.490
After serving you, I realize that's true.

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:17.330
Really?

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:23.150
So I wrote a song that will 
inspire you to be sincere.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:43.830
This song will make me sincere?

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:45.470
Yes.

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:52.710
You think this is enough?

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:58.100
What?

00:16:58.100 --> 00:16:59.280
I'll write another, then!

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:00.200
Enough.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:01.210
What?

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:06.850
Today's your last day as my servant.

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:11.550
Camus-senpai, um...

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:24.690
Is something wrong?

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:27.500
Cecil-san...

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:30.850
Did Camus do something again?

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:31.860
No.

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:34.070
It's not that.

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:37.340
He was unimpressed by my song.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:40.520
By your song? Why?

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:43.330
I understand.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:46.270
I'm going to see Camus.

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:47.620
Wait, Cecil-san!

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:50.910
How dare he make light of your music!

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:52.130
You're wrong!

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:55.890
It's my fault.

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:56.470
What?

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:02.550
I wanted Camus-senpai to sing sincerely,

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:05.480
so I...

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:07.330
Haruka...

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:16.280
It's okay.

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:20.280
Your music puts a smile on my face.

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:22.980
Cheer up.

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:25.330
Cecil-san...

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:28.150
Thank you.

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:05.340
You, girl.

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:15.170
Camus-senpai.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:17.300
We have work. Let's go.

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:20.010
Okay, but...

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:30.310
What? What does three snaps mean?

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:36.590
Huh?

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:39.610
What?

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:42.320
Huh? What?

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:46.810
What?!

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:03.190
It's Camus-sama.

00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:05.140
Who's that girl with him?

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:06.760
Close your mouth.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:10.070
Who do you think you're with?

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:13.980
O-Okay. Sorry...

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:20.810
What?

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:23.950
Huh? He was just here...

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:31.890
Welcome to this celestial 
party above the clouds.

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:33.110
Camus-senpai?

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:37.120
For those of you here tonight,

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:44.960
under a sky full of stars and a brilliant moon, 
I, Camus, have a special gift.

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:55.810
This song...

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:57.230
Look up there!

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:15.920
Is this how he truly sings?

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:17.460
Camus-sama!

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:12.650
Hey. You said you wanted to know 
how I sing in earnest.

00:22:13.290 --> 00:22:14.730
Y-Yes...

00:22:18.470 --> 00:22:22.170
I am perfect in all ways 
without going that far.

00:22:25.850 --> 00:22:30.820
But being sincere sometimes isn't so bad.

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:33.800
Yes.

00:24:06.650 --> 00:24:07.710
Uta Pri.

00:24:07.710 --> 00:24:11.170
I'll be waiting for you here next week, miss.
